        "tekst": "**Try the circuit of culture on a security object (own addition).** Take a **doorbell camera**. *Production*: cheap cameras and cloud platforms from a few tech companies. *Representation*: adverts showing a safe family home and a caught thief. *Identity*: the responsible home-owner who protects the neighbourhood. *Consumption*: bought online, shared in neighbourhood apps. *Regulation*: privacy law on filming the public street. Each moment shows a different way the object shapes, and is shaped by, culture."
